{"id":"e51f537bfbd5e417","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-levy-jump-measure.md","title":"Pathwise Jump Measure of a Lévy Process","display":"df-levy-jump-measure — Pathwise Jump Measure of a Lévy Process","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-levy-jump-measure","aliases":["58-df-levy-jump-measure"],"display":"df-levy-jump-measure — Pathwise Jump Measure of a Lévy Process","depends_on":["[[58-df-levy-process]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-levy-jump-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-levy-jump-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-levy-jump-measure — Pathwise Jump Measure of a Lévy Process"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0a20d5f74408674\" href=\"?note=d0a20d5f74408674\" title=\"58-df-levy-process\">58-df-levy-process</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(d\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d0a20d5f74408674\" href=\"?note=d0a20d5f74408674\" title=\"58-df-levy-process\">58-df-levy-process</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^{\\omega_0}:t\\mapsto X_t(\\omega_0)\">\\(X^{\\omega_0}:t\\mapsto X_t(\\omega_0)\\)</span> (sample path for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_0\\in\\Omega\">\\(\\omega_0\\in\\Omega\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N:\\Omega\\to\\overline{\\mathbb N}^{\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R_+\\times(\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\}))}\">\\(N:\\Omega\\to\\overline{\\mathbb N}^{\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R_+\\times(\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\}))}\\)</span> (candidate random counting measure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LevyJumpMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LevyJumpMeasure}_S\\)</span> (random jump-measure predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}levy\\text{-}jump\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{LevyJumpMeasure}_S(N,X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)\\leftrightarrow d\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)\\land N:\\Omega\\to\\overline{\\mathbb N}^{\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R_+\\times(\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\}))}\\land\\forall\\omega_0\\in\\Omega\\;\\forall W\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R_+\\times(\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\}))\\;N(\\omega_0)(W)=\\#\\{s&gt;0:\\exists z\\in\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(z=X_s(\\omega_0)-\\lim_{u\\uparrow s}X_u(\\omega_0)\\land(s,z)\\in W)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}levy\\text{-}jump\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{LevyJumpMeasure}_S(N,X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)\\leftrightarrow d\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\land\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)\\land N:\\Omega\\to\\overline{\\mathbb N}^{\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R_+\\times(\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\}))}\\land\\forall\\omega_0\\in\\Omega\\;\\forall W\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R_+\\times(\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\}))\\;N(\\omega_0)(W)=\\#\\{s&gt;0:\\exists z\\in\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(z=X_s(\\omega_0)-\\lim_{u\\uparrow s}X_u(\\omega_0)\\land(s,z)\\in W)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The sample point is explicit: a Lévy jump measure is a random counting measure, not a deterministic count attached only to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>On rectangles <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(0,t]\\times B\">\\((0,t]\\times B\\)</span>, it counts jumps by time <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> whose sizes lie in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>; its intensity is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\nu(B)\">\\(t\\nu(B)\\)</span> when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> is the Lévy measure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-levy-process","status":"resolved","id":"d0a20d5f74408674","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-levy-process]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-levy-process","status":"resolved","id":"d0a20d5f74408674","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$d\\in\\omega_{>0}$ and $\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)$ (see [[58-df-levy-process]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"d\\in\\omega_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)","display":false},{"tex":"X^{\\omega_0}:t\\mapsto X_t(\\omega_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega_0\\in\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"N:\\Omega\\to\\overline{\\mathbb N}^{\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R_+\\times(\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\}))}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LevyJumpMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}levy\\text{-}jump\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\mathrm{LevyJumpMeasure}_S(N,X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)\\leftrightarrow d\\in\\omega_{>0}\\land\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,d)\\land N:\\Omega\\to\\overline{\\mathbb N}^{\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R_+\\times(\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\}))}\\land\\forall\\omega_0\\in\\Omega\\;\\forall W\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R_+\\times(\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\}))\\;N(\\omega_0)(W)=\\#\\{s>0:\\exists z\\in\\mathbb R^d\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;(z=X_s(\\omega_0)-\\lim_{u\\uparrow s}X_u(\\omega_0)\\land(s,z)\\in W)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"(0,t]\\times B","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"t\\nu(B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu","display":false}],"bytes":1580,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-772","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-levy-jump-measure.md|58-df-levy-jump-measure]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["d0a20d5f74408674"]}